A drafter-plugin hook for llama.cpp: --spec-type plugin loads a drafter from a shared library
(common/speculative-plugin.h), so MemDraft ships as memdraft/plugin/libmemdraft.so instead of a patch
to llama.cpp's drafter code. Made against llama.cpp master edec462 (2026-11-18).

    cd llama.cpp && git apply /path/to/memdraft/llama-plugin-hook.patch

New options: --spec-plugin FNAME, --spec-plugin-args KEY=VALUE,..., --spec-plugin-n-max N,
--spec-plugin-prefix N (the draft model, e.g. draft-mtp, drafts the first N tokens and the plugin continues).
Example plugins (n-gram drafters, a draft model, an MTP head) are in memdraft/plugin/examples.

